<title>FRANCE: Cocao Barry top managers leave Barry Callebaut.</title>
<headline>Cocao Barry top managers leave Barry Callebaut.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chocolate company Barry Callebaut AG said Patrick Bendavid and Sami Demal had left the company.</p>
<p>The two led the Cocao Barry group for 15 years until Swiss Klaus J Jacobs Holding bought the company from Societe Centrale d'Investissements and merged it with its Callebaut unit on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
